{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012980/extras/steam_banners_03_DE.png?t=1741884994\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An all-new installment!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap into your kart and jump into the fastest poultry race of all time. This ultimate championship title chase offers you a brand new racing experience,  with improved driving physics, revised cartoon graphics and head-over-wheels loops, alongside crossplay and online multiplayer too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012980/extras/steam_banners_01.png?t=1741884994\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Full speed, awesome action!</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Criss-cross and drive head-over-heels through the Moorhuhn universe: discover <strong>adventurous tracks</strong> with unique challenges and hidden shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Configure your karts</strong> and use all kinds of tricks to gain the upper hand over your opponents! Choose from <strong>12 new and revised items</strong>, such as the tried and tested 16 ton weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against crazy chickens and other well-known characters to prove you're the fastest driver around. There's even a new character - <strong>Midnight, the friendly bat</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now with <strong>cross-platform online multiplayer</strong> for up to 8 players, letting you connect with your friends, or find new rivals from the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local multiplayer</strong>:  play with up to 4 players on a single screen and experience the racing spectacle together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single player</strong> and <strong>Grand Prix</strong> modes against AI opponents.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012980/extras/steam_banners_02.png?t=1741884994\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adrenaline Junkie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/e206f92ec5beb6ccdcf602ff59ea631db5135a57.jpg"},{"name":"Time Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/de2be068a85c68d21860a12fa5875c7f1ab77c1d.jpg"},{"name":"Mechanic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/5dc89a563d6a1d21e7b8232035cfb61532941dbe.jpg"},{"name":"Body Shop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/6ac62278b61ba319eceea48d27924a642011e6d8.jpg"},{"name":"Wheelwright","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/d8f1962dd616a692a1db03a7361c70118fbf265b.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/f8abac15d6f12b996f5e0e22fba11e5f8d828d53.jpg"},{"name":"Down to the Wire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/511f2d8fcb5ee0980ff2601404cfa26cb8b19d7f.jpg"},{"name":"Double Tap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/834b2a6501c661dbd4859b4edc57a0c52e8170fb.jpg"},{"name":"Rocket Redirection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/8d7eda7154ffdc4ff7827c6bdf370aec7bbcfbe3.jpg"},{"name":"Two Birds, One Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3012980/f491c5125f35fe98c9e319347ea756d4a150f30a.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3012980?t=1741884994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012980/page_bg_r